# pjdfstest cases excluded when the work directory is on ramfs, one per line in
# the form `<category>/<nn>.t` relative to the suite's `tests/` directory.
# Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored.
#
# This is applied on top of whatever `runlist` selects, so a case listed in both
# does not run. A `CONFORMANCE_TEST_SELECTOR` overrides this list entirely, so
# an individual blocked case can still be rerun on demand.
#
# Each filesystem has its own copy of this list. A case blocked here is not
# blocked on ext2; see `../ext2/blocklist` for that side.

